{"id":"d001-nonaction-01","family_id":"nonaction-frustration","utterance":"This keeps happening every time I export the file.","locale":"en-NZ","split":"development","provenance":{"kind":"synthetic","source_ref":"batch-001","generation_method":"hand-authored"},"domains":["non_action_boundary","technology"],"capabilities":["intent_classification","safe_preservation","interaction_policy"],"difficulty":"intermediate","expected":{"interaction_mode":"preserve","semantic_acts":[{"act_type":"report","predicate":"problem_recurs","polarity":"positive","modality":"asserted","arguments":[{"role":"object","value":"problem"},{"role":"condition","value":"every time file is exported"}]}],"rationale":"The user reports frustration or a recurring issue but has not explicitly requested a fix or task."},"annotation":{"review_status":"draft","review_note":"Product may choose to offer help, but must not silently create a task."}}
{"id":"d001-nonaction-02","family_id":"nonaction-observation-completed","utterance":"The room is finally tidy and the labels are all correct.","locale":"en-NZ","split":"development","provenance":{"kind":"synthetic","source_ref":"batch-001","generation_method":"hand-authored"},"domains":["non_action_boundary","home_and_family"],"capabilities":["report_vs_commitment","intent_classification","safe_preservation"],"difficulty":"basic","expected":{"interaction_mode":"no_op","semantic_acts":[{"act_type":"state","predicate":"room_tidy","polarity":"positive","modality":"asserted","arguments":[{"role":"object","value":"room"}]},{"act_type":"state","predicate":"labels_correct","polarity":"positive","modality":"asserted","arguments":[{"role":"object","value":"labels"}]}],"rationale":"This is a status statement without a request, commitment, or useful update instruction."},"annotation":{"review_status":"draft","review_note":"Distinguish no-op from preserving a potentially useful memory."}}
{"id":"d001-nonaction-03","family_id":"nonaction-quoted-command","utterance":"The sign literally says “keep this door closed”, but I'm asking why it has that rule.","locale":"en-NZ","split":"development","provenance":{"kind":"synthetic","source_ref":"batch-001","generation_method":"hand-authored"},"domains":["non_action_boundary","communication"],"capabilities":["question_vs_action","report_vs_commitment","safe_preservation"],"difficulty":"hard","expected":{"interaction_mode":"answer","semantic_acts":[{"act_type":"report","predicate":"sign_text","polarity":"positive","modality":"asserted","arguments":[{"role":"content","value":"keep this door closed"}]},{"act_type":"question","predicate":"explain_rule","polarity":"positive","modality":"requested","arguments":[{"role":"object","value":"door-closed rule"}]}],"rationale":"The quoted imperative is mentioned, not issued to the assistant; the actual request is a question."},"annotation":{"review_status":"draft","review_note":"Important boundary case: quoted instruction must not be executed as the user's instruction."}}
{"id":"d001-specialist-01","family_id":"specialist-unknown-predicate","utterance":"Ask Niko whether the specimen needs cryostabilisation before the next imaging pass.","locale":"en-NZ","split":"development","provenance":{"kind":"synthetic","source_ref":"batch-001","generation_method":"hand-authored"},"domains":["unfamiliar_specialist","healthcare_administration"],"capabilities":["unknown_vocabulary","condition_and_dependency","entity_and_argument_binding","action_composition"],"difficulty":"hard","expected":{"interaction_mode":"act","semantic_acts":[{"act_type":"action","predicate":"ask","polarity":"positive","modality":"requested","arguments":[{"role":"recipient","value":"Niko"},{"role":"question","value":"whether specimen needs cryostabilisation"}],"constraints":[{"type":"time","value":"before next imaging pass","relation":"deadline"}]}],"rationale":"Unfamiliar technical vocabulary should be retained intact inside the question and its dependency."},"annotation":{"review_status":"draft","review_note":"Synthetic specialist term; validate that the expected label does not depend on domain knowledge."}}
{"id":"d001-specialist-02","family_id":"specialist-conditional-hypothesis","utterance":"If the calibration curve is non-monotonic, could that explain the residual pattern?","locale":"en-NZ","split":"development","provenance":{"kind":"synthetic","source_ref":"batch-001","generation_method":"hand-authored"},"domains":["unfamiliar_specialist","education_research"],"capabilities":["condition_and_dependency","modality_and_uncertainty","question_vs_action","safe_preservation"],"difficulty":"adversarial","expected":{"interaction_mode":"answer","semantic_acts":[{"act_type":"condition","predicate":"calibration_curve_is_non_monotonic","polarity":"positive","modality":"conditional","arguments":[{"role":"object","value":"calibration curve"}]},{"act_type":"question","predicate":"evaluate_possible_explanation","polarity":"positive","modality":"requested","arguments":[{"role":"cause","value":"non-monotonic calibration curve"},{"role":"effect","value":"residual pattern"}]}],"rationale":"The condition and possible causal explanation remain uncertain; the question does not assert the condition is true."},"annotation":{"review_status":"draft","review_note":"Check that question mode remains answer even when the condition is unresolved."}}
{"id":"d001-family-01","family_id":"family-context-list-update","utterance":"Add the batteries too, but leave the charger off that list.","locale":"en-NZ","split":"development","provenance":{"kind":"synthetic","source_ref":"batch-001","generation_method":"hand-authored"},"domains":["home_and_family","cross_domain"],"capabilities":["contextual_update","reference_resolution","negation_and_polarity","entity_and_argument_binding"],"difficulty":"intermediate","context":{"required_reference":"an existing shopping or packing list","context_available":false},"expected":{"interaction_mode":"clarify","semantic_acts":[{"act_type":"action","predicate":"append_list_item","polarity":"positive","modality":"requested","arguments":[{"role":"object","value":"batteries"},{"role":"target_list","value":"that list"}]},{"act_type":"action","predicate":"append_list_item","polarity":"negative","modality":"prohibited","arguments":[{"role":"object","value":"charger"},{"role":"target_list","value":"that list"}]}],"rationale":"The add/exclude contrast is clear but the target list is not available in context."},"annotation":{"review_status":"draft","review_note":"Review whether system should ask for the list or use the currently active list if one exists."}}
{"id":"d001-family-02","family_id":"family-schedule-relative","utterance":"Move dinner later by half an hour, unless that clashes with her lesson.","locale":"en-NZ","split":"development","provenance":{"kind":"synthetic","source_ref":"batch-001","generation_method":"hand-authored"},"domains":["home_and_family","everyday_personal"],"capabilities":["temporal_resolution","condition_and_dependency","reference_resolution","interaction_policy"],"difficulty":"hard","context":{"required_references":["dinner","her lesson"],"context_available":false},"expected":{"interaction_mode":"clarify","semantic_acts":[{"act_type":"action","predicate":"reschedule","polarity":"positive","modality":"requested","arguments":[{"role":"object","value":"dinner"},{"role":"change","value":"30 minutes later"}],"constraints":[{"type":"condition","value":"does not conflict with her lesson"}]}],"rationale":"The timing operation is clear, but the schedule and the person/lesson reference need context to safely apply it."},"annotation":{"review_status":"draft","review_note":"Clarification should be minimal; avoid asking about already clear parts."}}
{"id":"d001-sequence-01","family_id":"sequence-export-then-delete","utterance":"Export the archive, verify it opens, and only then delete the temporary copy.","locale":"en-NZ","split":"development","provenance":{"kind":"synthetic","source_ref":"batch-001","generation_method":"hand-authored"},"domains":["technology","office_client"],"capabilities":["multi_action_sequencing","condition_and_dependency","interaction_policy","action_composition"],"difficulty":"hard","expected":{"interaction_mode":"act","semantic_acts":[{"act_type":"action","predicate":"export_archive","polarity":"positive","modality":"requested","arguments":[{"role":"object","value":"archive"}]},{"act_type":"action","predicate":"verify_opens","polarity":"positive","modality":"requested","arguments":[{"role":"object","value":"exported archive"}],"constraints":[{"type":"condition","value":"archive exported","relation":"after"}]},{"act_type":"action","predicate":"delete_temporary_copy","polarity":"positive","modality":"conditional","arguments":[{"role":"object","value":"temporary copy"}],"constraints":[{"type":"condition","value":"export verified to open","relation":"only then"}]}],"rationale":"The destructive step is explicitly gated by successful export and verification."},"annotation":{"review_status":"draft","review_note":"Check whether execution authorization should require confirmation for deletion; semantics are not permission."}}
{"id":"d001-sequence-02","family_id":"sequence-dont-repeat","utterance":"Check the address once, and if it matches the booking, don't look it up again.","locale":"en-NZ","split":"development","provenance":{"kind":"synthetic","source_ref":"batch-001","generation_method":"hand-authored"},"domains":["travel_logistics","office_client"],"capabilities":["condition_and_dependency","negation_and_polarity","action_composition"],"difficulty":"hard","expected":{"interaction_mode":"act","semantic_acts":[{"act_type":"action","predicate":"verify_address","polarity":"positive","modality":"requested","arguments":[{"role":"object","value":"address"}],"constraints":[{"type":"quantity","value":"once"}]},{"act_type":"action","predicate":"look_up_address_again","polarity":"negative","modality":"prohibited","arguments":[{"role":"object","value":"address"}],"constraints":[{"type":"condition","value":"address matches booking"}]}],"rationale":"The repeated lookup is prohibited only when the first check matches; preserve the condition."},"annotation":{"review_status":"draft","review_note":"Review whether 'once' is an execution constraint or merely emphasis."}}
{"id":"d001-context-01","family_id":"context-resolve-one-of-two","utterance":"Use the newer one, but keep the measurements from the first.","locale":"en-NZ","split":"development","provenance":{"kind":"synthetic","source_ref":"batch-001","generation_method":"hand-authored"},"domains":["cross_domain","creative"],"capabilities":["reference_resolution","contextual_update","entity_and_argument_binding","safe_preservation"],"difficulty":"adversarial","context":{"required_references":["newer one","first"],"context_available":false},"expected":{"interaction_mode":"clarify","semantic_acts":[{"act_type":"action","predicate":"select_version","polarity":"positive","modality":"requested","arguments":[{"role":"object","value":"newer version"}]},{"act_type":"action","predicate":"preserve_attribute","polarity":"positive","modality":"requested","arguments":[{"role":"object","value":"measurements"},{"role":"source","value":"first version"}]}],"rationale":"The intended combination is understandable, but the referenced versions cannot be identified without context."},"annotation":{"review_status":"draft","review_note":"Check if one clarification can request both version referents."}}
{"id":"d001-context-02","family_id":"context-no-referent-keep","utterance":"Don't change it yet; I'm still comparing the options.","locale":"en-NZ","split":"development","provenance":{"kind":"synthetic","source_ref":"batch-001","generation_method":"hand-authored"},"domains":["cross_domain","everyday_personal"],"capabilities":["negation_and_polarity","modality_and_uncertainty","reference_resolution","safe_preservation"],"difficulty":"intermediate","context":{"required_reference":"an item or setting under discussion","context_available":false},"expected":{"interaction_mode":"preserve","semantic_acts":[{"act_type":"action","predicate":"change_referent","polarity":"negative","modality":"prohibited","arguments":[{"role":"object","value":"it"}]},{"act_type":"state","predicate":"comparing_options","polarity":"positive","modality":"asserted","arguments":[{"role":"object","value":"options"}]}],"rationale":"The prohibition is meaningful even if the referent is not available; preserve the instruction and do not guess what 'it' is."},"annotation":{"review_status":"draft","review_note":"Product context should retain the constraint for the active item without creating an invented task."}}
